{"name": "Well Keeper", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img alt=\"Flappy bullet hell\" class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365940/extras_big/8c7c44f89e56686a2b1b1c90a8d86b8f.webp?t=1779195191\" height=\"134\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365940/extras/8c7c44f89e56686a2b1b1c90a8d86b8f.avif?t=1779195191\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as a lightning-charged mouse who flaps its ears to move. Fight increasingly difficult monsters with automatically fired bolts of lightning as your primary weapon. You\u2019ll be on the edge of your seat through 30 distinct waves across three levels. Each wave is unique and has a different attack, making every encounter tense, unpredictable, and packed with action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video aria-label=\"Mouse flapping through many projectiles\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"480\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365940/extras/425e951d3a5f1e8a0abc339d564fdb0e.poster.avif?t=1779195191\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365940/extras/425e951d3a5f1e8a0abc339d564fdb0e.webm?t=1779195191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365940/extras/425e951d3a5f1e8a0abc339d564fdb0e.mp4?t=1779195191\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img alt=\"Powerful upgrades\" class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365940/extras_big/e88330b82892a79c1b0d27fe0ab60494.webp?t=1779195191\" height=\"195\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365940/extras/e88330b82892a79c1b0d27fe0ab60494.avif?t=1779195191\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect coins from defeated enemies to upgrade 24 different properties and unique abilities called \u201cWishes.\u201d These include powerful new weapons, economic effects, weapon modifiers, stat boosts, and more, fueling a strong progression curve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video aria-label=\"Upgrades\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"480\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365940/extras/9d77568589543a636d71c10d55731821.poster.avif?t=1779195191\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365940/extras/9d77568589543a636d71c10d55731821.webm?t=1779195191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365940/extras/9d77568589543a636d71c10d55731821.mp4?t=1779195191\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img alt=\"Epic boss battles\" class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365940/extras_big/a50d2a0043fb2bea99931607a60f2c0f.webp?t=1779195191\" height=\"195\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365940/extras/a50d2a0043fb2bea99931607a60f2c0f.avif?t=1779195191\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Conquer huge bosses at the end of each level. With layered attack patterns and multiple phases, these extended battles deliver a distinct challenge beyond regular enemy waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video aria-label=\"Boss fight\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"480\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365940/extras/99b888dc1bb3fcbce4fd76d0d069b389.poster.avif?t=1779195191\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365940/extras/99b888dc1bb3fcbce4fd76d0d069b389.webm?t=1779195191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365940/extras/99b888dc1bb3fcbce4fd76d0d069b389.mp4?t=1779195191\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img alt=\"Immense power trip\" class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365940/extras_big/fdd5b22a1fb0f47b66126d31ee0f3b7a.webp?t=1779195191\" height=\"195\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365940/extras/fdd5b22a1fb0f47b66126d31ee0f3b7a.avif?t=1779195191\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When defeated, you lose your coins and restart from the beginning of the level, but keep your acquired Wishes. This makes you more powerful each time you begin a new run, creating a thrilling sense of exponential domination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video aria-label=\"Mouse becoming powerful and shooting many projectiles\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"480\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365940/extras/ea671fe50d4a9f0f925ac71a67b53e04.poster.avif?t=1779195191\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365940/extras/ea671fe50d4a9f0f925ac71a67b53e04.webm?t=1779195191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365940/extras/ea671fe50d4a9f0f925ac71a67b53e04.mp4?t=1779195191\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img alt=\"Distinctive flap-style movement\" class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365940/extras_big/2ce5e6ef6af70af4004dfdf7c38b29ff.webp?t=1779195191\" height=\"195\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365940/extras/2ce5e6ef6af70af4004dfdf7c38b29ff.avif?t=1779195191\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Flap left or right to move horizontally, and adjust your flapping speed to control altitude. You can also dash sideways to dodge tricky projectiles. This simple control scheme is easy to learn, yet offers expressive, skillful movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"480\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365940/extras/0e32af452124d5d962d15e930d09b1f0.poster.avif?t=1779195191\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365940/extras/0e32af452124d5d962d15e930d09b1f0.webm?t=1779195191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365940/extras/0e32af452124d5d962d15e930d09b1f0.mp4?t=1779195191\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "A bullet hell roguelite where you move by flapping. Battle waves of enemies, upgrade unique and unexpected abilities and become immensely powerful!", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365940/6e04a383058a2923116884e5527353a2956cfed3/header.jpg?t=1779195191", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Roguelite", "Bullet Hell", "Arcade", "Action", "Roguelike", "Action Roguelike"], "developers": "Corporate Potato", "publishers": "Corporate Potato", "release_date": "Apr 23, 2026", "price": "$7.99", "appid": "3365940", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "27 September 2025 - Request Access\n\n10 November 2025 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/bxGUKHcx0eo", "first_seen": 1758931200.0, "review_rank": 1469}